From 58a703566d2983d96cef5657b9cbf4cabf622daa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicole Muzzin <nicole@muzz.in>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:41:55 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] layout: paint a selected line break as a selected space

Like Blink, when a selection continues past the end of a line (a <br>, a
preserved newline, a soft wrap or the end of a paragraph), the highlight
extends by the width of a space.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
